# The three board views on the same Standard mid-game (two turns played, the white knight picked up on the present board):
# Settings -> Display -> "Board view" is cycled through Atlas, Blueprint and back to Deep space (the default), and each time
# a Standard game is opened with `mode standard`. Layout (1400x800): main menu Settings (150,460); Display tab (880,172);
# the Board view button is the first of the two Display options (700,468); in the game Back (125,25) leads to the mode list,
# whose single Back button is (700,712). Squares are clicked by name, see game-standard.ui.
wait 20
click 150 460        # Settings
wait 30
click 880 172        # Display tab
wait 20
click 700 468        # Board view: Atlas
wait 10
capture board-style-settings-atlas
mode standard
wait 40
clicksq 0 0 e2
wait 20
clicksq 0 0 e4
wait 20
click 841 90         # Submit
wait 60
clicksq 0 1 e7
wait 20
clicksq 0 1 e5
wait 20
click 841 90
wait 60
clicksq 0 2 g1       # pick up the knight: its targets show on the present board
wait 60
capture board-style-atlas
click 125 25         # Back to the mode list ...
wait 30
click 700 712        # ... and to the main menu
wait 30
click 150 460        # Settings
wait 30
click 880 172        # Display tab
wait 20
click 700 468        # Board view: Blueprint
wait 10
mode standard
wait 40
clicksq 0 0 e2
wait 20
clicksq 0 0 e4
wait 20
click 841 90
wait 60
clicksq 0 1 e7
wait 20
clicksq 0 1 e5
wait 20
click 841 90
wait 60
clicksq 0 2 g1
wait 60
capture board-style-blueprint
click 125 25
wait 30
click 700 712
wait 30
click 150 460
wait 30
click 880 172
wait 20
click 700 468        # Board view: Deep space again
wait 10
mode standard
wait 40
clicksq 0 0 e2
wait 20
clicksq 0 0 e4
wait 20
click 841 90
wait 60
clicksq 0 1 e7
wait 20
clicksq 0 1 e5
wait 20
click 841 90
wait 60
clicksq 0 2 g1
wait 60
capture board-style-deep-space
